  "description": "After months of patience, the market is finally rewarding aggression",
  "body_html": "<p>After an incredibly slow October and November (in which we were cash), we began deploying capital again in December. Stocks were finally stopping their descent and showing signs of life. There was no “Santa’s rally”, more like a “Santa snooze”…but it seems Santa just woke up late and has been energetic as ever. Stocks have been absolutely parabolic since the start of 2026. </p><p>Expectations going forward: </p><h4><strong>The Next Leg Higher Will Have a Sector Leader 📈</strong></h4><p>Finance. This is predominantly more legacy based finance stocks (think like banks) instead of more tech based finance (think like Affirm, Paypal, Sofi). The predominant reason was the plethora of volatility contraction patterns (VCP), the top investing chart pattern utilized by Mark Minervini - 2 time U.S. Investing Champion. Additionally, many of them have been raking in profits quietly, so the fundamentals are there. Out of the 333 stocks that met <em><strong>basic</strong></em> investing criteria, 30 had a VCP and 22 of those were in finance. Stand by for buy alerts in the coming month. Simply waiting for the consolidation breakouts right now. You can watch to learn more here: <em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF Build Video</a></strong></em></p><h4><strong>Silver is looking spicy</strong> 🌶️</h4><p>No, this is not a top call. In fact, I do not think the top is in. No one can time tops perfectly, including me. However there are several warning flags occurring. Online gurus that are about 20 years old, with apparently 30 years of experience on Wall Street (sarcasm), are circle jerking silver while frothing at the mouth about silver with their retail following…meanwhile they said nothing about silver a year ago. (Additionally multiple triple bearish divergences are appearing on the charts for silver and silver related assets. You can read more here: <em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-flash-update-silver?r=4z8lgl\">Silver Warning</a></strong></em></p><h4><strong>Compound Your Winners! Stop Buying “Cheap” Stocks</strong></h4><p>Seeing a lot of posts…per usual…of people buying dips. Massive dips! Thinking they got a discount. Only to soon after witness the discount wasn’t the bottom. Shocking. Saw this a lot with Adobe, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;ADBE&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> this week. While many were hemorrhaging their portfolios, we were adding to our winning stocks and picked up a few more. The latest stock is only up about 5.5% this week…I don’t chase 5% gains, so I think it is still good for a buy with more runway. You can check that stock out here:<em><strong> <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocks-trending-with-strategytime?r=4z8lgl\">Stocks Are Working! Buying More…</a></strong></em></p><h4><strong>Stock portfolio is performing well</strong></h4><p>Planet Labs, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;PL&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> is leading the charge at +54% right now. And this is not the only one, a result of the process I have developed, not luck. Stock names and full position details are available for paid subscribers. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_Rmb!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fef4910b0-f09d-4339-a05e-003b2883d96d_72x158.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_Rmb!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fef4910b0-f09d-4339-a05e-003b2883d96d_72x158.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_Rmb!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fef4910b0-f09d-4339-a05e-003b2883d96d_72x158.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_Rmb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fef4910b0-f09d-4339-a05e-003b2883d96d_72x158.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_Rmb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fef4910b0-f09d-4339-a05e-003b2883d96d_72x158.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"158\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/ef4910b0-f09d-4339-a05e-003b2883d96d_72x158.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:158,&quot;width&quot;:72,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:2756,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/184762144?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fef4910b0-f09d-4339-a05e-003b2883d96d_72x158.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_Rmb!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fef4910b0-f09d-4339-a05e-003b2883d96d_72x158.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_Rmb!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fef4910b0-f09d-4339-a05e-003b2883d96d_72x158.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_Rmb!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fef4910b0-f09d-4339-a05e-003b2883d96d_72x158.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!_Rmb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fef4910b0-f09d-4339-a05e-003b2883d96d_72x158.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Current portfolio performance. Every position has when the stock was entered, recommended stop ranges and includes updates.</figcaption></figure></div><p>Broader indexes remain healthy and volatility is cooperating, we are mostly buying up stocks that I expect will have the <strong>biggest</strong> runs.</p><p>If you have any questions, as always I am available in the main chat during market hours. If you are not a subscriber and have questions, also feel free to send me a DM or leave a comment on one of my posts; I read <em><strong>everything</strong></em> here. Paid subscribers receive real-time buy alerts, portfolio allocations and trims, explanations to holds and cuts, and access to live market chat during trading hours. </p><p>Oh, if you like this content…please leave a like ❤️, re-stack and share the post with someone. This is so critical and I hate asking…but I am competing with anonymous AI slop accounts out there. The only way we can get ahead of them is by engagement. </p><p>Have a great weekend and thanks for stopping by! </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a> |</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/the-stocktok-playbook-everything?r=4z8lgl\">The StockTok Playbook</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong></em> <em><strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary button-wrapper\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><p>Other Resources: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a>  </p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/capital-is-being-deployed-again?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">If you actually liked this post…share it with someone you like. If you didn’t like this post, share it with someone you don’t like and spam their inbox. </p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/capital-is-being-deployed-again?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=e